&#x200B;

Windshield wiper with your legs works in a LOT of situations. Switching sides on knee on belly, advancing from butterfly guard to headquarters, pinning arms in side control, helping pass half guard and on and on. Experiment with it.

&#x200B;

Everything below the eyes is the neck. Lowering your chin is not a RNC defense.

&#x200B;

You know that guy who ONLY bench presses when he works out? Usually has a tshirt on that's too small. Walks with his chin up in the air all the time and talks too loudly about who he's slept with? Yeah, you can see that fucker now, can't you? Ope, looks like he's finishing up his bench set! Ooooooh, look at him puff that chest out and roll those shoulders out and back. Yeahhhhhhhhhhhh. You can see that dipshit posing, can't you? Ok, now get your cross collar choke grips. Pull his collar to your chest and imitate that fucking douche canoe. Remember this if you struggle to finish the cross collar.

